8 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"sr-only\">Section titled “What is VibeCode?”</span></a></div>
<p>VibeCode is an <strong>infrastructure-first</strong> cloud-native development platform that combines the power of AI-driven project generation with enterprise-grade security and observability. Built on Kubernetes with a complete VS Code experience in the cloud.</p>
<div class=\"card-grid astro-zntqmydn\"><article class=\"card sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc\"> <p class=\"title sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc\"> <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon astro-v5tidmuc astro-c6vsoqas\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"--sl-icon-size: 1.333em;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M1.44 8.855v-.001l3.527-3.516c.34-.344.802-.541 1.285-.548h6.649l.947-.947c3.07-3.07 6.207-3.072 7.62-2.868a1.821 1.821 0 0 1 1.557 1.557c.204 1.413.203 4.55-2.868 7.62l-.946.946v6.649a1.845 1.845 0 0 1-.549 1.286l-3.516 3.528a1.844 1.844 0 0 1-3.11-.944l-.858-4.275-4.52-4.52-2.31-.463-1.964-.394A1.847 1.847 0 0 1 .98 10.693a1.843 1.843 0 0 1 .46-1.838Zm5.379 2.017-3.873-.776L6.32 6.733h4.638l-4.14 4.14Zm8.403-5.655c2.459-2.46 4.856-2.463 5.89-2.33.134 1.035.13 3.432-2.329 5.891l-6.71 6.71-3.561-3.56 6.71-6.711Zm-1.318 15.837-.776-3.873 4.14-4.14v4.639l-3.364 3.374Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"/><path d=\"M9.318 18.345a.972.972 0 0 0-1.86-.561c-.482 1.435-1.687 2.204-2.934 2.619a8.22 8.22 0 0 1-1.23.302c.062-.365.157-.79.303-1.229.415-1.247 1.184-2.452 2.62-2.935a.971.971 0 1 0-.62-1.842c-.12.04-.236.084-.35.13-2.02.828-3.012 2.588-3.493 4.033a10.383 10.383 0 0 0-.51 2.845l-.001.016v.063c0 .536.434.972.97.972H2.24a7.21 7.21 0 0 0 .878-.065c.527-.063 1.248-.19 2.02-.447 1.445-.48 3.205-1.472 4.033-3.494a5.828 5.828 0 0 0 .147-.407Z\"/></svg> <span class=\"astro-v5tidmuc\">🚀 AI Project Generation</span> </p> <div class=\"body astro-v5tidmuc\"><p>Transform natural language prompts into production-ready codebases using Claude-3.5-Sonnet and multiple AI providers.</p></div> </article> <article class=\"card sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc\"> <p class=\"title sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc\"> <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon astro-v5tidmuc astro-c6vsoqas\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"--sl-icon-size: 1.333em;\"><path d=\"M21 14h-1V7a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H7a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h14a3 3 0 0 0 3-3v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1ZM6 7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7H6V7Zm14 10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-1h16v1Z\"/></svg> <span class=\"astro-v5tidmuc\">🖥️ Live VS Code Experience</span> </p> <div class=\"body astro-v5tidmuc\"><p>Full IDE via code-server with real-time collaboration, not a limited web editor.</p></div> </article> <article class=\"card sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc\"> <p class=\"title sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc\"> <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon astro-v5tidmuc astro-c6vsoqas\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"--sl-icon-size: 1.333em;\"></svg> <span class=\"astro-v5tidmuc\">📊 Multi-Platform Observability</span> </p> <div class=\"body astro-v5tidmuc\"><p>Hybrid monitoring stack: Datadog + Prometheus + Vector + OpenTelemetry support.</p></div> </article> <article class=\"card sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc\"> <p class=\"title sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc\"> <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon astro-v5tidmuc astro-c6vsoqas\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"--sl-icon-size: 1.333em;\"></svg> <span class=\"astro-v5tidmuc\">🔐 Enterprise Security</span> </p> <div class=\"body astro-v5tidmuc\"><p>Authelia 2FA/SSO, hardware keys, TOTP, integrated security scanning with Kubehound.</p></div> </article> </div>·
<div class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\"><h2 id=\"key-features\">Key Features</h2><a class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#key-features\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"sr-only\">Section titled “Key Features”</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>Infrastructure-First</strong>: KIND (Kubernetes in Docker) orchestration eliminates 60-80% custom development</li>
<li><strong>Multi-AI Provider Support</strong>: Avoid vendor lock-in with intelligent routing across 6+ AI models</li>
<li><strong>Production-Ready</strong>: NGINX Ingress, cert-manager, Helm charts, persistent storage</li>
<li><strong>Accessibility Compliance</strong>: WCAG 2.1 AA compliant with comprehensive testing</li>
<li><strong>Open Source</strong>: MIT license with permissive dependencies (Apache 2.0, BSD, MPL-2.0)</li>
</ul>
<div class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\"><h2 id=\"architecture-overview\">Architecture Overview</h2><a class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#architecture-overview\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"sr-only\">Section titled “Architecture Overview”</span></a></div>
<p>VibeCode leverages a <strong>hybrid observability stack</strong> that provides both enterprise features and vendor independence:</p>
<div class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\"><h3 id=\"primary-default-datadog--prometheus--vector-hybrid\">Primary (Default): Datadog + Prometheus + Vector Hybrid</h3><a class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#primary-default-datadog--prometheus--vector-hybrid\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"sr-only\">Section titled “Primary (Default): Datadog + Prometheus + Vector Hybrid”</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>Datadog Agent + Cluster Agent</strong>: Full-featured SaaS platform (commercial license)</li>
<li><strong>Prometheus</strong>: Open source metrics collection (Apache 2.0 license)</li>
<li><strong>Vector</strong>: High-performance log/metrics router (MPL-2.0 license, by Datadog)</li>
<li><strong>Combined Benefits</strong>: Enterprise features + vendor independence + high-performance data pipeline</li>
</ul>
<div class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\"><h3 id=\"alternative-options-permissive-licenses\">Alternative Options (Permissive Licenses)</h3><a class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#alternative-options-permissive-licenses\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"sr-only\">Section titled “Alternative Options (Permissive Licenses)”</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>OpenTelemetry Collector</strong>: Vendor-neutral telemetry (Apache 2.0 license)</li>
<li><strong>Grafana</strong>: Visualization layer (AGPL v3 license)</li>
<li><strong>Full Open Source Stack</strong>: Prometheus + OpenTelemetry + Vector + Grafana</li>
</ul>
<div class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\"><h3 id=\"security-analysis\">Security Analysis</h3><a class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#security-analysis\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"sr-only\">Section titled “Security Analysis”</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>Kubehound</strong>: Kubernetes attack path analysis (by Datadog, open source)</li>
</ul>
